1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,256
Myth or fact?

2
00:00:01,256 --> 00:00:09,850
You only register for VAT once your sales have already passed three hundred and seventy-five thousand dirhams.

3
00:00:10,550 --> 00:00:10,935
Myth.

4
00:00:10,935 --> 00:00:22,262
The threshold is three hundred and seventy-five thousand dirhams of taxable supplies and imports, and the Federal Tax Authority applies two tests.

5
00:00:22,962 --> 00:00:25,681
Look back over the past twelve months.

6
00:00:25,681 --> 00:00:34,269
And look ahead: if you expect taxable supplies and imports to exceed it in the next thirty days, you must register too.

7
00:00:34,969 --> 00:00:40,918
So check both tests every month, and again when you sign a large contract.

8
00:00:40,918 --> 00:00:41,803
Questions?

9
00:00:41,803 --> 00:00:43,732
Talk to us on WhatsApp.

10
00:00:43,732 --> 00:00:47,833
General information only, not legal or tax advice.
